# LocalFlowCorrection
# DistancesFrames
# v14
# 2015-05-22
# Ivan Baldry <i.baldry@ljmu.ac.uk>
#
# This table provides redshifts in various reference frames,
# flow-corrected redshifts, and distance moduli for all GAMA II
# objects with redshifts.
#
CATAID          1  -    meta.id;meta.main            Unique GAMA ID of object
RA              2  deg  pos.eq.ra                    J2000 coordinate
DEC             3  deg  pos.eq.dec                   J2000 coordinate
NQ              4  -    meta.code.qual;src.redshift  Quality of redshift
Z_HELIO         5  -    src.redshift                 Heliocentric redshift
Z_LG            6  -    src.redshift                 Local Group frame redshift
Z_CMB           7  -    src.redshift                 CMB frame redshift 
Z_TONRY         8  -    src.redshift                 Flow-corrected redshift using Tonry et al. model
Z_TONRY_HIGH    9  -    src.redshift                 Recomputed after adjusting z_helio by +180 km/s
Z_TONRY_LOW    10  -    src.redshift                 Recomputed after adjusting z_helio by -180 km/s
DM_70_30_70    11  mag  phot.mag.distMod             Distance modulus for 737 cosmology
DM_100_30_70   12  mag  phot.mag.distMod             Distance modulus for H0=100, om_m=0.30, om_L=0.70
DM_70_25_75    13  mag  phot.mag.distMod             Distance modulus for H0=70, om_m=0.25, om_L=0.75
DM_100_25_75   14  mag  phot.mag.distMod             Distance modulus for H0=100, om_m=0.25, om_L=0.75
